="2:50.619" end="2:51.041">ra,</span><span begin="2:51.318" end="2:51.821">ko e</span><span begin="2:51.821" end="2:51.920">ga</span><span begin="2:51.920" end="2:52.309">su</span><span begin="2:52.309" end="2:52.526">ru</span><span begin="2:52.526" end="2:52.881">no</span></text><text for="L37"><span begin="2:53.147" end="2:53.501">&quot;so</span><span begin="2:53.501" end="2:53.738">re</span><span begin="2:53.738" end="2:53.965">de</span><span begin="2:53.965" end="2:54.172">mo&quot;</span><span begin="2:54.172" end="2:54.448">t</span><span begin="2:54.448" end="2:56.607">te</span></text><text for="L38"><span begin="2:57.568" end="2:57.812">a</span><span begin="2:57.812" end="2:58.053">re</span><span begin="2:58.053" end="2:58.288">ka</span><span begin="2:58.288" end="2:58.789">ra</span><span begin="2:59.015" end="2:59.239">ma</span><span begin="2:59.239" end="2:59.689">da</span> <span begin="2:59.971" end="3:00.210">o</span><span begin="3:00.210" end="3:00.436">wa</span><span begin="3:00.436" end="3:00.681">ra</span><span begin="3:00.681" end="3:00.931">na</span><span begin="3:00.931" end="3:01.170">i</span><span begin="3:01.170" end="3:01.669">yu me</span><span begin="3:01.669" end="3:01.922">no</span><span begin="3:01.922" end="3:02.108">to</span><span begin="3:02.108" end="3:04.073">chu u</span></text><text for="L39"><span begin="3:05.233" end="3:05.501">mi</span><span begin="3:05.501" end="3:05.961">ra i</span><span begin="3:05.961" end="3:06.479">no</span><span begin="3:06.641" end="3:06.938">hi</span><span begin="3:06.938" end="3:07.369">no</span> <span begin="3:07.633" end="3:07.852">ka</span><span begin="3:07.852" end="3:08.098">ko</span><span begin="3:08.098" end="3:08.380">wo</span><span begin="3:08.380" end="3:08.851">i ma</span><span begin="3:08.851" end="3:09.070">ka</span><span begin="3:09.070" end="3:09.177">e</span><span begin="3:09.177" end="3:09.341">te</span><span begin="3:09.341" end="3:09.421">mi</span><span begin="3:09.421" end="3:09.811">se</span><span begin="3:09.811" end="3:10.179">te</span></text></transliteration></transliterations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="3:10.179"><div begin="1.151" end="3:10.179"><p begin="1.151" end="5.034" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1.151" end="1.623" amll:empty-beat="1">歩</span><span begin="1.623" end="1.869">き</span><span begin="1.869" end="2.376" amll:empty-beat="1">始</span><span begin="2.376" end="2.597">め</span><span begin="2.597" end="2.902">た</span><span begin="3.064" end="3.564" amll:empty-beat="1">時</span><span begin="3.564" end="3.803">か</span><span begin="3.803" end="3.930">ら</span><span begin="3.930" end="4.085">今</span><span begin="4.085" end="4.302">日</span><span begin="4.302" end="4.503">の</span><span begin="4.503" end="4.779">日</span><span begin="4.779" end="4.893">ま</span><span begin="4.893" end="5.034">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">从迈出第一步的那天 直至今日 / From the moment I first set out, all the way to today</span></p><p begin="5.216" end="8.651" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="5.216" end="5.339">見</span><span begin="5.339" end="5.484">え</span><span begin="5.484" end="5.741">な</span><span begin="5.741" end="6.190">い</span><span begin="6.190" end="6.670" amll:empty-beat="1">何</span><span begin="6.670" end="6.918">か</span><span begin="6.918" end="7.116">を</span><span begin="7.116" end="7.410">追</span><span begin="7.410" end="7.922">い</span><span begin="8.104" end="8.219">か</span><span begin="8.219" end="8.355">け</span><span begin="8.355" end="8.651">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">一直在追逐着看不见的某物 / I&apos;ve been chasing something I could never see</span></p><p begin="8.816" end="12.866" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="8.816" end="9.077">ど</span><span begin="9.077" end="9.299">こ</span><span begin="9.299" end="9.547">ま</span><span begin="9.547" end="9.684">で</span><span begin="9.684" end="10.007">往</span><span begin="10.007" end="10.262">く</span><span begin="10.262" end="10.557">の</span> <span begin="10.746" end="11.233" amll:empty-beat="1">何</span><span begin="11.233" end="11.459">の</span><span begin="11.459" end="11.936" amll:empty-beat="1">為</span><span begin="11.936" end="12.171">生</span><span begin="12.171" end="12.443">き</span><span begin="12.443" end="12.565">る</span><span begin="12.565" end="12.866">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">要往何处去 又是为何而活 / How far am I going? What am I living for?</span></p><p begin="12.866" end="16.998" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="12.894" end="13.054">言</span><span begin="13.054" end="13.171">え</span><span begin="13.171" end="13.421">な</span><span begin="13.421" end="13.855">い</span><span begin="13.855" end="14.110">ま</span><span begin="14.110" end="14.359">ま</span><span begin="14.359" end="14.602">に</span><span begin="14.602" end="15.069" amll:empty-beat="1">脚</span><span begin="15.069" end="15.798">を</span><span begin="15.798" end="15.910">止</span><span begin="15.910" end="16.030">め</span><span begin="16.030" end="16.509">た</span> <span begin="16.509" end="16.749">あ</span><span begin="16.749" end="16.998">あ、</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">始终说不出口 就这样停下了脚步 啊… / With no answer, my steps just came to a stop, ah...</span></p><p begin="32.579" end="36.399" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="32.579" end="32.785">完</span><span begin="32.785" end="33.077">成</span><span begin="33.077" end="33.334">形</span><span begin="33.334" end="33.543">は</span><span begin="33.543" end="33.682">野</span><span begin="33.682" end="33.943" amll:empty-beat="1">放</span><span begin="33.943" end="34.050">図</span><span begin="34.050" end="34.401">で</span> <span begin="34.523" end="34.699" amll:empty-beat="1">感</span><span begin="34.699" end="35.011" amll:empty-beat="1">情</span><span begin="35.011" end="35.246">の</span><span begin="35.246" end="35.362">食</span><span begin="35.362" end="35.475">い</span><span begin="35.475" end="35.775" amll:empty-beat="1">違</span><span begin="35.775" end="35.842">っ</span><span begin="35.842" end="35.980">た</span><span begin="35.980" end="36.399">り</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">所谓完成形 是没有边际的 时而与感性相悖 / The final shape turned wild, out of step with what I feel</span></p><p begin="36.434" end="40.234" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="36.434" end="36.556">だ</span><span begin="36.556" end="36.689">れ</span><span begin="36.689" end="36.905">も</span><span begin="36.905" end="37.021">理</span><span begin="37.021" end="37.396" amll:empty-beat="1">想</span><span begin="37.396" end="37.533">を</span><span begin="37.533" end="37.866" amll:empty-beat="1">望</span><span begin="37.866" end="38.239">む</span> <span begin="38.310" end="38.579" amll:empty-beat="1">役</span><span begin="38.579" end="38.748">も</span><span begin="38.748" end="38.982" amll:empty-beat="1">酸</span><span begin="38.982" end="39.303">素</span><span begin="39.303" end="39.419">も</span><span begin="39.419" end="39.659">取</span><span begin="39.659" end="39.758">り</span><span begin="39.758" end="39.959">合</span><span begin="39.959" end="40.234">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">谁都在渴望理想 连角色和氧气也相互争抢 / Everyone&apos;s chasing ideals, fighting for roles, for air to breathe</span></p><p begin="40.264" end="43.775" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="40.264" end="40.390">あ</span><span begin="40.390" end="40.521">の</span><span begin="40.521" end="40.742">日</span><span begin="40.742" end="40.995">か</span><span begin="40.995" end="41.221">ら</span><span begin="41.221" end="41.360">焼</span><span begin="41.360" end="41.561">き</span><span begin="41.561" end="41.725">付</span><span begin="41.725" end="41.954">い</span><span begin="41.954" end="42.408">て</span> <span begin="42.647" end="42.756">消</span><span begin="42.756" end="42.955">え</span><span begin="42.955" end="43.085">な</span><span begin="43.085" end="43.775">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">自那天起便烙印心底 无法消去 / Since that day, something burned itself into me</span></p><p begin="44.043" end="46.273" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.043" end="44.231">モ</span><span begin="44.231" end="44.333">ニ</span><span begin="44.333" end="44.455">タ</span><span begin="44.455" end="44.587">ー</span><span begin="44.587" end="44.737">の</span><span begin="44.737" end="45.176" amll:empty-beat="1">先</span><span begin="45.176" end="45.427">の</span><span begin="45.427" end="45.549">な</span><span begin="45.549" end="45.753">に</span><span begin="45.753" end="46.273">か</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">屏幕另一端的某种东西 / Something is waiting on the other side of the screen</span></p><p begin="46.505" end="49.978" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="46.505" end="47.005" amll:empty-beat="1">例</span><span begin="47.005" end="47.125">え</span><span begin="47.125" end="47.344">ば</span><span begin="47.344" end="47.464">過</span><span begin="47.464" end="47.719">去</span><span begin="47.719" end="48.194">に</span> <span begin="48.438" end="48.683" amll:empty-beat="1">戻</span><span begin="48.683" end="48.940">れ</span><span begin="48.940" end="49.040">ば</span><span begin="49.040" end="49.128">ど</span><span begin="49.128" end="49.217">う</span><span begin="49.217" end="49.404">し</span><span begin="49.404" end="49.489">よ</span><span begin="49.489" end="49.616">う</span><span begin="49.616" end="49.978">か</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">譬如说 如果回到过去 会怎么样呢 / If I could go back to the past</span></p><p begin="50.344" end="53.919" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="50.344" end="50.455">ど</span><span begin="50.455" end="50.591">こ</span><span begin="50.591" end="50.839">か</span><span begin="50.839" end="50.948">で</span><span begin="50.948" end="51.323" amll:empty-beat="1">忘</span><span begin="51.323" end="51.556">れ</span><span begin="51.556" end="51.912">た</span> <span begin="52.271" end="52.530" amll:empty-beat="1">夢</span><span begin="52.530" end="52.745">を</span><span begin="52.745" end="53.006" amll:empty-beat="1">選</span><span begin="53.006" end="53.087">ん</span><span begin="53.087" end="53.218">で</span><span begin="53.218" end="53.348">み</span><span begin="53.348" end="53.456">た</span><span begin="53.456" end="53.919">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">试着选择在某处被遗忘的梦想 / And choose a dream I left behind somewhere</span></p><p begin="53.988" end="55.891" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.988" end="54.459" amll:empty-beat="1">案</span><span begin="54.459" end="54.693" amll:empty-beat="1">外</span><span begin="54.693" end="54.814">上</span><span begin="54.814" end="55.063">手</span><span begin="55.063" end="55.173">く</span><span begin="55.173" end="55.354" amll:empty-beat="1">いっ</span><span begin="55.354" end="55.891">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">竟意外顺利 / Maybe things would turn out fine</span></p><p begin="56.123" end="1:02.130" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="56.123" end="56.253">で</span><span begin="56.253" end="56.392">も</span><span begin="56.392" end="56.739" amll:empty-beat="1">別</span><span begin="56.739" end="56.914">の</span><span begin="56.914" end="57.098">世</span><span begin="57.098" end="57.343" amll:empty-beat="1">界</span><span begin="57.343" end="57.775">の</span><span begin="58.024" end="58.293" amll:empty-beat="1">君</span><span begin="58.293" end="58.559">は</span> <span begin="58.559" end="58.897" amll:empty-beat="1">今</span><span begin="58.897" end="59.009">の</span><span begin="59.009" end="59.247" amll:empty-beat="1">君</span><span begin="59.247" end="59.731">に</span><span begin="59.731" end="59.994">な</span><span begin="59.994" end="1:00.224">り</span><span begin="1:00.224" end="1:00.452">た</span><span begin="1:00.452" end="1:00.687">い</span><span begin="1:00.687" end="1:01.178">か</span><span begin="1:01.178" end="1:02.130">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">可是 另一个世界里的你 或许正想成为此刻的你 / But the &quot;you&quot; in that other world might wish to be the &quot;you&quot; you are now</span></p><p begin="1:02.614" end="1:06.491" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.614" end="1:02.852">だ</span><span begin="1:02.852" end="1:03.084">れ</span><span begin="1:03.084" end="1:03.330">も</span><span begin="1:03.330" end="1:03.393">が</span><span begin="1:03.393" end="1:03.811">識</span><span begin="1:03.811" end="1:04.048">れ</span><span begin="1:04.048" end="1:04.156">な</span><span begin="1:04.156" end="1:04.325">い</span> <span begin="1:04.460" end="1:04.771">世</span><span begin="1:04.771" end="1:05.249" amll:empty-beat="1">界</span><span begin="1:05.249" end="1:05.361">の</span><span begin="1:05.361" end="1:05.942" amll:empty-beat="1">歩</span><span begin="1:05.942" end="1:06.181">き</span><span begin="1:06.181" end="1:06.491" amll:empty-beat="1">方</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">谁都不知晓的 世界的行走方式 / We all walk through worlds no one else has known</span></p><p begin="1:06.681" end="1:10.062" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.681" end="1:06.790">見</span><span begin="1:06.790" end="1:06.902">え</span><span begin="1:06.902" end="1:07.222">な</span><span begin="1:07.222" end="1:07.635">い</span><span begin="1:07.635" end="1:08.137" amll:empty-beat="1">答</span><span begin="1:08.137" end="1:08.357">え</span><span begin="1:08.357" end="1:08.611">を</span><span begin="1:08.611" end="1:08.851">追</span><span begin="1:08.851" end="1:09.555">い</span><span begin="1:09.555" end="1:09.675">か</span><span begin="1:09.675" end="1:09.792">け</span><span begin="1:09.792" end="1:10.062">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">追逐着看不见的答案 / Chasing answers we can&apos;t see</span></p><p begin="1:10.281" end="1:14.249" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:10.281" end="1:10.502">ど</span><span begin="1:10.502" end="1:10.775">こ</span><span begin="1:10.775" end="1:11.015">ま</span><span begin="1:11.015" end="1:11.152">で</span><span begin="1:11.152" end="1:11.397">往</span><span begin="1:11.397" end="1:11.489">っ</span><span begin="1:11.489" end="1:11.735">て</span><span begin="1:11.735" end="1:12.223">も</span> <span begin="1:12.223" end="1:12.699" amll:empty-beat="1">何</span><span begin="1:12.699" end="1:12.885">の</span><span begin="1:12.885" end="1:13.429" amll:empty-beat="1">為</span><span begin="1:13.429" end="1:13.630">生</span><span begin="1:13.630" end="1:13.887">き</span><span begin="1:13.887" end="1:14.022">て</span><span begin="1:14.022" end="1:14.249">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">无论走到哪里 无论为何而活 / No matter how far we go, or what we live for</span></p><p begin="1:14.342" end="1:17.771" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:14.342" end="1:14.481">癒</span><span begin="1:14.481" end="1:14.610">え</span><span begin="1:14.610" end="1:14.729">な</span><span begin="1:14.729" end="1:15.321">い</span><span begin="1:15.321" end="1:15.812" amll:empty-beat="1">傷</span><span begin="1:15.812" end="1:16.005">は</span><span begin="1:16.005" end="1:16.271">増</span><span begin="1:16.271" end="1:16.532">え</span><span begin="1:16.532" end="1:17.255">る</span><span begin="1:17.255" end="1:17.379">け</span><span begin="1:17.379" end="1:17.492">れ</span><span begin="1:17.492" end="1:17.771">ど</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">虽然无法痊愈的伤痕在增加 / The wounds that won&apos;t heal only grow but still</span></p><p begin="1:17.982" end="1:18.603" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:17.982" end="1:18.199">行</span><span begin="1:18.199" end="1:18.443">こ</span><span begin="1:18.443" end="1:18.603">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">出发吧 / We go on</span></p><p begin="1:34.053" end="1:37.650" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:34.053" end="1:34.230" amll:empty-beat="1">大</span><span begin="1:34.230" end="1:34.516">事</span><span begin="1:34.516" end="1:34.760">に</span><span begin="1:34.760" end="1:35.123" amll:empty-beat="1">握</span><span begin="1:35.123" end="1:35.262">り</span><span begin="1:35.262" end="1:35.481">締</span><span begin="1:35.481" end="1:35.728">め</span> <span begin="1:35.947" end="1:36.208" amll:empty-beat="1">歪</span><span begin="1:36.208" end="1:36.465">ん</span><span begin="1:36.465" end="1:36.705">で</span><span begin="1:36.705" end="1:36.929">い</span><span begin="1:36.929" end="1:37.038">た</span><span begin="1:37.038" end="1:37.291">希</span><span begin="1:37.291" end="1:37.650" amll:empty-beat="1">望</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">曾珍重紧握 却已扭曲的希望 / The hope I held so tightly twisted out of shape</span></p><p begin="1:37.889" end="1:41.487" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:37.889" end="1:38.128" amll:empty-beat="1">高</span><span begin="1:38.128" end="1:38.358">く</span><span begin="1:38.358" end="1:38.587">飛</span><span begin="1:38.587" end="1:38.699">ぼ</span><span begin="1:38.699" end="1:38.817">う</span><span begin="1:38.817" end="1:38.918">と</span><span begin="1:38.918" end="1:39.222">す</span><span begin="1:39.222" end="1:39.318">れ</span><span begin="1:39.318" end="1:39.609">ば</span> <span begin="1:39.809" end="1:40.057" amll:empty-beat="1">深</span><span begin="1:40.057" end="1:40.277">く</span><span begin="1:40.277" end="1:40.496">落</span><span begin="1:40.496" end="1:40.739">ち</span><span begin="1:40.739" end="1:40.846">て</span><span begin="1:40.846" end="1:41.145">し</span><span begin="1:41.145" end="1:41.244">ま</span><span begin="1:41.244" end="1:41.487">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">越想飞得高 就会坠得越深 / Whenever I tried to fly higher, I only fell deeper</span></p><p begin="1:41.722" end="1:44.899" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:41.722" end="1:41.906" amll:empty-beat="1">泥</span><span begin="1:41.906" end="1:42.194" amll:empty-beat="1">水</span><span begin="1:42.194" end="1:42.291">を</span><span begin="1:42.291" end="1:42.566" amll:empty-beat="1">啜</span><span begin="1:42.566" end="1:42.706">っ</span><span begin="1:42.706" end="1:42.802">て</span><span begin="1:42.802" end="1:43.003">も</span> <span begin="1:43.003" end="1:43.415" amll:empty-beat="1">花</span><span begin="1:43.415" end="1:43.896">に</span><span begin="1:44.137" end="1:44.249">な</span><span begin="1:44.249" end="1:44.377">れ</span><span begin="1:44.377" end="1:44.505">な</span><span begin="1:44.505" end="1:44.899">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">即使啜饮泥水 也无法化作花朵 / Even drinking muddy water won&apos;t turn me into a flower</span></p><p begin="1:45.568" end="1:46.930" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:45.568" end="1:45.811" amll:empty-beat="1">思</span><span begin="1:45.811" end="1:46.060">い</span><span begin="1:46.060" end="1:46.278">通</span><span begin="1:46.278" end="1:46.495">り</span><span begin="1:46.495" end="1:46.662">じゃ</span><span begin="1:46.662" end="1:46.832">な</span><span begin="1:46.832" end="1:46.930">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">不能如愿 / Nothing goes the way I want it to</span></p><p begin="1:47.026" end="1:52.270" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:47.026" end="1:47.226" amll:empty-beat="1">夢</span><span begin="1:47.500" end="1:47.648">の</span><span begin="1:47.732" end="1:47.832">ま</span><span begin="1:47.963" end="1:48.063">た</span><span begin="1:48.208" end="1:48.308" amll:empty-beat="1">夢</span><span begin="1:48.699" end="1:48.880">の</span><span begin="1:48.930" end="1:49.173">な</span><span begin="1:49.173" end="1:49.468">か</span> <span begin="1:49.657" end="1:49.897">な</span><span begin="1:49.897" end="1:50.119">に</span><span begin="1:50.119" end="1:50.380">を</span><span begin="1:50.545" end="1:51.101" amll:empty-beat="1">啜</span><span begin="1:51.101" end="1:51.401">る？</span><span begin="1:51.562" end="1:52.270">「 」</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">在梦中之梦里 要写下什么？「 」 / Inside a dream, within a dream, what will you write? &quot; &quot;</span></p><p begin="1:52.547" end="1:54.401" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:52.547" end="1:52.782">ど</span><span begin="1:52.782" end="1:53.003">こ</span><span begin="1:53.003" end="1:53.370">に</span><span begin="1:53.746" end="1:53.965" amll:empty-beat="1">届</span><span begin="1:53.965" end="1:54.401">く？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">要传到哪里去？ / Where will it reach?</span></p><p begin="1:54.670" end="1:58.049" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:54.670" end="1:54.870" amll:empty-beat="1">夢</span><span begin="1:55.159" end="1:55.259">は</span><span begin="1:55.388" end="1:55.488">ま</span><span begin="1:55.660" end="1:55.760">だ</span><span begin="1:55.882" end="1:56.361" amll:empty-beat="1">夢</span><span begin="1:56.361" end="1:56.620">の</span><span begin="1:56.620" end="1:56.858">ま</span><span begin="1:56.858" end="1:57.081">ま</span><span begin="1:57.210" end="1:57.805" amll:empty-beat="1">進</span><span begin="1:57.805" end="1:58.049">む</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">梦想仍以梦的形态前进 / The dream goes on, still only a dream</span></p><p begin="1:58.268" end="2:02.139" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:58.268" end="1:58.521">止</span><span begin="1:58.521" end="1:58.771">ま</span><span begin="1:58.771" end="1:59.238">ら</span><span begin="1:59.238" end="1:59.731">な</span><span begin="1:59.731" end="2:00.208">い</span><span begin="2:00.208" end="2:00.687" amll:empty-beat="1">者</span><span begin="2:00.687" end="2:01.190">は</span><span begin="2:01.390" end="2:01.668" amll:empty-beat="1">転</span><span begin="2:01.668" end="2:02.139">ぶ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">不肯停下的人会跌倒 / If you keep moving, you&apos;ll stumble,</span></p><p begin="2:02.339" end="2:06.441" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:02.339" end="2:02.439">け</span><span begin="2:02.619" end="2:02.719">れ</span><span begin="2:02.835" end="2:02.935">ど</span><span begin="2:03.059" end="2:03.159">景</span><span begin="2:03.216" end="2:03.802" amll:empty-beat="1">色</span><span begin="2:03.802" end="2:04.043">は</span><span begin="2:04.043" end="2:04.294">変</span><span begin="2:04.294" end="2:04.534">わ</span><span begin="2:04.534" end="2:06.441">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但景色在改变 / But the scenery will change</span></p><p begin="2:18.668" end="2:22.308" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:18.668" end="2:19.091" amll:empty-beat="1">今</span><span begin="2:19.091" end="2:19.510">更</span><span begin="2:19.510" end="2:19.646">わ</span><span begin="2:19.646" end="2:19.801">か</span><span begin="2:19.801" end="2:19.887">っ</span><span begin="2:19.887" end="2:20.396">た</span> <span begin="2:20.619" end="2:20.759">生</span><span begin="2:20.759" end="2:20.870">ま</span><span begin="2:20.870" end="2:21.100">れ</span><span begin="2:21.100" end="2:21.225">た</span><span begin="2:21.225" end="2:21.457">き</span><span begin="2:21.457" end="2:21.582">た</span><span begin="2:21.582" end="2:21.710">意</span><span begin="2:21.710" end="2:21.830">味</span><span begin="2:21.830" end="2:22.308">が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">事到如今才明白 降生于世的意义 / Now I finally understand the meaning of being born</span></p><p begin="2:22.438" end="2:24.209" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:22.438" end="2:22.609">死</span><span begin="2:22.609" end="2:22.778">ね</span><span begin="2:22.778" end="2:22.990">な</span><span begin="2:22.990" end="2:23.128">い</span><span begin="2:23.128" end="2:23.361">理</span><span begin="2:23.361" end="2:23.719" amll:empty-beat="1">由</span><span begin="2:23.719" end="2:24.209">が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">和无法死去的理由 / The reason I can&apos;t just die</span></p><p begin="2:24.421" end="2:28.030" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:24.421" end="2:24.687" amll:empty-beat="1">下</span><span begin="2:24.687" end="2:24.927">書</span><span begin="2:24.927" end="2:24.985">き</span><span begin="2:24.985" end="2:25.295">す</span><span begin="2:25.295" end="2:25.407">ら</span><span begin="2:25.407" end="2:25.543">も</span><span begin="2:25.543" end="2:25.666">無</span><span begin="2:25.666" end="2:25.939">い</span> <span begin="2:26.175" end="2:26.628" amll:empty-beat="1">何</span><span begin="2:26.628" end="2:26.851">か</span><span begin="2:26.851" end="2:26.980">が</span><span begin="2:26.980" end="2:27.215">見</span><span begin="2:27.215" end="2:27.346">た</span><span begin="2:27.346" end="2:27.467">い</span><span begin="2:27.467" end="2:27.583">ん</span><span begin="2:27.583" end="2:28.030">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">只是想看见些 连草稿都没有的某物 / I want to see something with no draft, no outline at all</span></p><p begin="2:28.270" end="2:29.978" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:28.270" end="2:28.522" amll:empty-beat="1">思</span><span begin="2:28.522" end="2:28.767">う</span><span begin="2:28.767" end="2:28.885">ま</span><span begin="2:28.885" end="2:29.125">ま</span><span begin="2:29.125" end="2:29.237">描</span><span begin="2:29.237" end="2:29.370">き</span><span begin="2:29.370" end="2:29.449">出</span><span begin="2:29.449" end="2:29.859">そ</span><span begin="2:29.859" end="2:29.978">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">随心描绘吧 / So I&apos;ll draw it exactly as I feel</span></p><p begin="2:30.145" end="2:34.440" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:30.145" end="2:30.458" amll:empty-beat="1">後</span><span begin="2:30.458" end="2:30.687">書</span><span begin="2:30.687" end="2:30.823">き</span><span begin="2:30.823" end="2:31.024">で</span><span begin="2:31.024" end="2:31.186">あ</span><span begin="2:31.186" end="2:31.290">れ</span><span begin="2:31.290" end="2:31.408">こ</span><span begin="2:31.408" end="2:31.693">れ</span> <span begin="2:31.899" end="2:32.620" amll:empty-beat="1">語</span><span begin="2:32.620" end="2:32.839">れ</span><span begin="2:32.839" end="2:33.335">ば</span><span begin="2:33.335" end="2:33.684">い</span><span begin="2:33.684" end="2:34.440">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">待到后记再把种种说出来就好 / And save the explanations for the afterword</span></p><p begin="2:34.757" end="2:38.709" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:34.757" end="2:35.219" amll:empty-beat="1">僕</span><span begin="2:35.219" end="2:35.488">ら</span><span begin="2:35.488" end="2:35.559">は</span><span begin="2:35.559" end="2:35.687">識</span><span begin="2:35.687" end="2:35.969">っ</span><span begin="2:35.969" end="2:36.102">て</span><span begin="2:36.102" end="2:36.218">い</span><span begin="2:36.218" end="2:36.621">る</span> <span begin="2:36.621" end="2:36.928">世</span><span begin="2:36.928" end="2:37.369" amll:empty-beat="1">界</span><span begin="2:37.369" end="2:37.543">の</span><span begin="2:37.543" end="2:38.096" amll:empty-beat="1">歩</span><span begin="2:38.096" end="2:38.353">き</span><span begin="2:38.353" end="2:38.709" amll:empty-beat="1">方</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我们知晓 世界的行走方式 / We already know our own way of walking the world</span></p><p begin="2:38.829" end="2:42.257" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:38.829" end="2:38.979">だ</span><span begin="2:38.979" end="2:39.088">か</span><span begin="2:39.088" end="2:39.780">ら</span><span begin="2:39.780" end="2:40.000">今</span><span begin="2:40.000" end="2:40.257">日</span><span begin="2:40.257" end="2:40.525">こ</span><span begin="2:40.525" end="2:40.769">こ</span><span begin="2:40.769" end="2:41.019">ま</span><span begin="2:41.019" end="2:41.720">で</span><span begin="2:41.720" end="2:41.859">来</span><span begin="2:41.859" end="2:41.985">た</span><span begin="2:41.985" end="2:42.257">ろ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">所以才来到了今天这里 对吧？ / That&apos;s how we made it this far, isn&apos;t it?</span></p><p begin="2:42.417" end="2:46.360" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:42.417" end="2:42.927" amll:empty-beat="1">始</span><span begin="2:42.927" end="2:43.187">ま</span><span begin="2:43.187" end="2:43.278">り</span><span begin="2:43.278" end="2:43.569">の</span><span begin="2:43.569" end="2:43.882">日</span><span begin="2:43.882" end="2:44.126">の</span> <span begin="2:44.326" end="2:44.426">行</span><span begin="2:44.584" end="2:44.684">く</span><span begin="2:44.832" end="2:45.032" amll:empty-beat="1">宛</span><span begin="2:45.337" end="2:45.437">も</span><span begin="2:45.562" end="2:46.007">願</span><span begin="2:46.007" end="2:46.179">い</span><span begin="2:46.179" end="2:46.360">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">启程那天的 去向和心愿 / The hopes and destinations we had on the very first day</span></p><p begin="2:46.510" end="2:49.889" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:46.510" end="2:46.659">ど</span><span begin="2:46.659" end="2:46.790">れ</span><span begin="2:46.790" end="2:47.441">も</span><span begin="2:47.441" end="2:47.739">予</span><span begin="2:47.739" end="2:48.203" amll:empty-beat="1">定</span><span begin="2:48.203" end="2:48.391">と</span><span begin="2:48.391" end="2:48.927" amll:empty-beat="1">違</span><span begin="2:48.927" end="2:49.395">う</span><span begin="2:49.395" end="2:49.524">け</span><span begin="2:49.524" end="2:49.655">れ</span><span begin="2:49.655" end="2:49.889">ど</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">虽都与计划不同 / All turned out different from what we planned</span></p><p begin="2:50.071" end="2:52.881" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:50.071" end="2:50.619">ほ</span><span begin="2:50.619" end="2:51.041">ら、</span><span begin="2:51.318" end="2:51.821" amll:empty-beat="1">声</span><span begin="2:51.821" end="2:51.920">が</span><span begin="2:51.920" end="2:52.309">す</span><span begin="2:52.309" end="2:52.526">る</span><span begin="2:52.526" end="2:52.881">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">快听，有声音在说 / But listen—there&apos;s a voice saying</span></p><p begin="2:53.147" end="2:56.607" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:53.147" end="2:53.501">「そ</span><span begin="2:53.501" end="2:53.738">れ</span><span begin="2:53.738" end="2:53.965">で</span><span begin="2:53.965" end="2:54.172">も」</span><span begin="2:54.172" end="2:54.448">っ</span><span begin="2:54.448" end="2:56.607">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">“即便如此” / &quot;Even so...&quot;</span></p><p begin="2:57.568" end="3:04.073" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:57.568" end="2:57.812">あ</span><span begin="2:57.812" end="2:58.053">れ</span><span begin="2:58.053" end="2:58.288">か</span><span begin="2:58.288" end="2:58.789">ら</span><span begin="2:59.015" end="2:59.239">ま</span><span begin="2:59.239" end="2:59.689">だ</span> <span begin="2:59.971" end="3:00.210">終</span><span begin="3:00.210" end="3:00.436">わ</span><span begin="3:00.436" end="3:00.681">ら</span><span begin="3:00.681" end="3:00.931">な</span><span begin="3:00.931" end="3:01.170">い</span><span begin="3:01.170" end="3:01.669" amll:empty-beat="1">夢</span><span begin="3:01.669" end="3:01.922">の</span><span begin="3:01.922" end="3:02.108">途</span><span begin="3:02.108" end="3:04.073">中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">自那以后 仍在未完结的梦的途中 / Since then, we&apos;re still inside a dream that hasn&apos;t ended</span></p><p begin="3:05.233" end="3:10.179" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:05.233" end="3:05.501">未</span><span begin="3:05.501" end="3:05.961" amll:empty-beat="1">来</span><span begin="3:05.961" end="3:06.479">の</span><span begin="3:06.641" end="3:06.938">日</span><span begin="3:06.938" end="3:07.369">の</span> <span begin="3:07.633" end="3:07.852">過</span><span begin="3:07.852" end="3:08.098">去</span><span begin="3:08.098" end="3:08.380">を</span><span begin="3:08.380" end="3:08.851" amll:empty-beat="1">今</span><span begin="3:08.851" end="3:09.070">変</span><span begin="3:09.070" end="3:09.177">え</span><span begin="3:09.177" end="3:09.341">て</span><span begin="3:09.341" end="3:09.421">み</span><span begin="3:09.421" end="3:09.811">せ</span><span begin="3:09.811" end="3:10.179">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">把未来之日的过去 现在就改变给你看 / I&apos;ll change the past of the future from right here, right now</span></p></div></body></tt>